       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. COMPUTE-DEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 PRINCIPAL-AMOUNT PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 50000.
       01 INTEREST-RATE PIC 99V99 VALUE 7.50.
       01 NUMBER-OF-YEARS PIC 99 VALUE 3.
       01 INTEREST-AMOUNT PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0.
       01 RESULT-VALUE PIC 9999 VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           COMPUTE INTEREST-AMOUNT =
               PRINCIPAL-AMOUNT * INTEREST-RATE *
               NUMBER-OF-YEARS / 100.
           DISPLAY "SIMPLE INTEREST: " INTEREST-AMOUNT.
           COMPUTE RESULT-VALUE = 2 + 3 * 4.
           DISPLAY "2 + 3 * 4 = " RESULT-VALUE.
           COMPUTE RESULT-VALUE = (2 + 3) * 4.
           DISPLAY "(2 + 3) * 4 = " RESULT-VALUE.
           STOP RUN.
